<h2>
"Single"
</h2>
<p>
"An active date"
<time>
"2024-01-15"
</time>
"and an inactive one"
<time>
"2024-01-15"
</time>
"."
</p>
<p>
"With a time:"
<time>
"2024-01-15 10:30"
</time>
"."
</p>
<h2>
"Ranges"
</h2>
<p>
"A same-day time range"
<time>
"2024-01-15 10:00"
</time>
"–"
<time>
"11:45"
</time>
"."
</p>
<p>
"A multi-day range"
<time>
"2024-01-15"
</time>
"–"
<time>
"2024-01-20"
</time>
"."
</p>
<h2>
"Ignored decorations"
</h2>
<p>
"A repeater is dropped:"
<time>
"2024-01-15"
</time>
"."
</p>
<h2>
"Not timestamps"
</h2>
<p>
"Comparisons like 3 < 4 and [not a stamp] stay literal text."
</p>
